msgid "The {name} tone report splits sorted data into draft underlying tone melody groups. Even before a linguist has been able to evaluate these groups, it may be helpful to record your sorted data. {name} can give you a window for each lexicon sense in a tone group, with a record button for each sorted sense-frame combination. \n\n"
